{
  "id": "ss.relic.feast",
  "name": "Larval feast",
  "description": "Three fat pale grubs piled on one another — one lying across the bottom, one wedged against it at a steeper angle, and the biggest sprawled over both — each a soft curved sausage of bone-white with a shaded belly, four segment creases, and a small brown head capsule at one end. The sizes, curves and angles all differ so it is a heap someone tipped out, not a pattern. The relic is three levels swallowed at once, so it draws three meals at once; ss.relic.husk is one upright empty shell and this is three full ones lying down.",
